    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "Hi, I was wondering if it is possible to get the file names first and have the directories come after for Pick *files*? \r\n\r\nfzf-lua:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6bc2d05d-fb3d-44df-9d5e-b6d08c941533)\r\n\r\nMiniPick:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5ad1b09f-8f1f-4e24-9ead-f55faee2b503)\r\n",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Hi, I was wondering if it is possible to get the file names first and have the directories come after for Pick <em>files</em>?</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">fzf-lua:<br>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/89947902/351268414-6bc2d05d-fb3d-44df-9d5e-b6d08c941533.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..WBkpsss9xdwrmlT-mXnjJJRY4TK-MVNXxA4YJhVqS64\"><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/89947902/351268414-6bc2d05d-fb3d-44df-9d5e-b6d08c941533.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..WBkpsss9xdwrmlT-mXnjJJRY4TK-MVNXxA4YJhVqS64\" alt=\"image\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">MiniPick:<br>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/89947902/351268827-5ad1b09f-8f1f-4e24-9ead-f55faee2b503.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..GZSOg-98Gis-VXTO4h-UZx8fSNrXgNgT7n88IXTOe5Y\"><img src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/89947902/351268827-5ad1b09f-8f1f-4e24-9ead-f55faee2b503.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..GZSOg-98Gis-VXTO4h-UZx8fSNrXgNgT7n88IXTOe5Y\" alt=\"image\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>",
    "bodyText": "Hi, I was wondering if it is possible to get the file names first and have the directories come after for Pick files?\nfzf-lua:\n\nMiniPick:",
    "category": {
        "createdAt": "2022-01-02T14:24:09Z",
        "description": "Ask the community for help",
        "emoji": ":pray:",
        "emojiHTML": "<div>🙏</div>",
